    {"serve llm",
      "Usage: bubo serve llm [OPTIONS]\n"
      "\n"
      "Start the OpenAI/Anthropic-compatible text LLM HTTP server.\n"
      "\n"
      "Model:\n"
      "  -m, --model <PATH>         GGUF model file or DiffusionGemma checkpoint directory (default: the model that 'bubo prepare' installed)\n"
      "      --mmproj <PATH>        Matching BF16 vision file (auto-discovered beside model)\n"
      "      --served-model-name <ID> Model identifier exposed by the OpenAI API (default: package ID or file stem)\n"
      "  -c, --context <N>          Context tokens per session (default: 0 = model native context)\n"
      "\n"
      "Sampling Defaults:\n"
      "  -n, --max-tokens <N>       Default new-token limit (default: -1 = until EOS or context full)\n"
      "  -t, --temperature <T>      Randomness scale; 0 selects greedy (default: model/thinking preset)\n"
      "      --top-k <K>            Highest-logit token limit; 0 disables (default: model preset)\n"
      "      --top-p <P>            Cumulative probability cutoff (default: model/thinking preset)\n"
      "      --min-p <P>            Keep tokens with probability at least P times the best token (default: 0.0 = disabled)\n"
      "      --min-keep <N>         Minimum candidates retained by enabled sampling filters (default: 0)\n"
      "  -s, --seed <N>             RNG seed for reproducible generation (default: -1 = random)\n"
      "      --repeat-penalty <N>   Multiplicative penalty for recently used tokens (default: 1.0 = disabled)\n"
      "      --repeat-last-n <N>    Trailing token window used by repetition penalties (default: 64; 0 = disabled)\n"
      "      --frequency-penalty <N> Penalty multiplied by each token's generated occurrence count (default: 0.0 = disabled)\n"
      "      --presence-penalty <N> Generated-token presence penalty (default: model/thinking preset)\n"
      "\n"
      "Reasoning Defaults:\n"
      "      --think <MODE>         Default reasoning mode: on, off, or auto (default: model)\n"
      "      --reasoning-effort <LEVEL> Default effort: auto, minimal, low, medium, high, xhigh, or max\n"
      "      --preserve-thinking <MODE> Replay prior reasoning: on, off, or auto\n"
      "\n"
      "Speculative:\n"
      "      --speculative <MODE>   HTTP draft backend: dspark, dflash2, mtp, or off\n"
      "      --dflash-model <PATH>  Path to Qwen DFlash2 GGUF file\n"
      "      --draft-policy <POLICY> Draft length: DFlash2 fixed or adaptive (default: adaptive); Gemma 4 MTP calibrated, confidence or fixed (default: calibrated)\n"
      "      --dspark-model <PATH>  Path to DeepSeek V4 Flash DSpark support GGUF file\n"
      "      --mtp-model <PATH>     Path to the Qwen MTP draft GGUF (Qwen3.8-Flash-Next: the mtp-...-shared-*.gguf file)\n"
      "  -d, --draft-tokens <N>     Maximum speculative draft tokens evaluated per step (default: 7; Gemma 4: 15)\n"
      "      --min-draft-tokens <N> Adaptive draft floor (default: 1)\n"
      "      --mtp-policy <POLICY>  Qwen3.8-Flash-Next sampled draft length: length (acceptance-history controller) or survival (stop on the draft head's confidence) (default: length)\n"
      "      --mtp-draft-vocab <VOCAB> Qwen3.8-Flash-Next draft head vocabulary: full, latin (special and ASCII/Latin-script text tokens; half the output head per draft step), or auto (latin until the output leaves that set, then full) (default: full)\n"
      "      --prompt-lookup        Qwen3.8-Flash-Next: after an MTP draft, propose the tokens that followed a 12+ token match earlier in the conversation\n"
      "\n"
      "Scheduling:\n"
      "      --prefill-chunk <N>    Maximum prompt tokens between active decode rounds (default: 512); DiffusionGemma: prompt tokens per encoder pass (default: 8192)\n"
      "      --max-pending <N>      Maximum queued generation requests (default: 16)\n"
      "      --max-pending-per-client <N> Maximum queued requests per client IP (default: --max-pending)\n"
      "      --request-timeout-ms <MS> Queue plus generation timeout; 0 disables it (default: 0)\n"
      "      --stall-timeout-ms <MS> Exit as device_lost when generation makes no progress for this long; at least 60000, 0 disables it (default: 0)\n"
      "      --max-output-bytes <N> Maximum generated bytes per request (default: 1048576)\n"
      "      --max-buffered-output-bytes <N> Maximum queued stream bytes per request (default: 65536)\n"
      "      --max-buffered-output-total <N> Maximum queued stream bytes across requests (default: 262144)\n"
      "\n"
      "Cache:\n"
      "      --cache-ram-bytes <N>  Retained RAM-cache byte budget (default: 0 = auto: half of free RAM, at most 32 GiB; explicit values may use free RAM minus 4 GiB)\n"
      "      --cache-disk <DIR>     Opt-in restart-safe continuation cache directory\n"
      "      --cache-disk-bytes <N> Retained disk-cache byte budget (default: 8589934592)\n"
      "      --cache-disk-staging-bytes <N> RAM limit for queued snapshots and each disk read (default: 0 = auto, at most the disk budget and 1/8 available RAM)\n"
      "\n"
      "Logging:\n"
      "      --log-progress         Log live prefill and decode progress (needs --log-level=info or debug)\n"
      "      --trace <PATH>         Append text request bodies, rendered prompts, generated text and replies to PATH as JSON Lines; the file holds client content\n"
      "      --log-level <LEVEL>    Log verbosity: error, warn, info or debug (default: info)\n"
      "  -v, --verbose              Shorthand for --log-level=debug\n"
      "\n"
      "Server:\n"
      "  -i, --host <IP>            Bind address\n"
      "  -p, --port <N>             Port to listen on\n"
      "  -j, --sessions <N>         Preallocated GPU request sessions\n"
      "      --max-connections <N>  Maximum simultaneous HTTP connections\n"
      "      --max-request-bytes <N> Maximum HTTP request body bytes\n"
      "      --api-key <KEY>        API key (or set BUBO_API_KEY)\n"
      "\n"
      "Debug:\n"
      "      --debug-hooks          Enable loopback debug diagnostics (default: off)\n"
      "      --max-score-tokens <N> Maximum teacher-forced prompt tokens (default: 8192)\n"
      "\n"
      "General:\n"
      "  -h, --help                 Print help\n"
      "\n"
      "Profiles:\n"
      "  --profile <default|subagents|exact|vanilla>\n"
      "  --exact                  Alias for --profile exact\n"
      "  --print-effective-settings  Print JSON and exit\n"
      "  --manifest PATH           Select bubo-package.json\n"
      "  --twin-model PATH --draft-head-model PATH\n"
      "  --verify-model            Hash eight manifest files plus distinct overrides\n"
      "                            (~2-4 minutes on SSD; before loading)\n"
      "  --no-behaviour --no-twin --no-draft-head --no-vision --no-mtp\n"
      "  --no-prompt-lookup --no-cache --no-cache-disk --allow-unmeasured-memory\n"
      "\n"
      "DiffusionGemma checkpoint directories:\n"
      "  Release profiles do not apply. --context, --sessions, --prefill-chunk, --max-tokens, --mmproj\n"
      "  and --served-model-name apply; the diffusion sampler replaces temperature, top-k,\n"
      "  top-p and penalties (a request seed still applies). Speculative decoding,\n"
      "  --cache-disk, --npu-prefill on and constrained JSON output are rejected.\n"},
