      "  -f, --file <PATH>          File path to read input prompt text from\n"
      "      --system <PROMPT>      Optional system role instructions prepended to the prompt\n"
      "      --raw                  Disable chat template framing and pass raw tokens\n"
      "      --no-display-prompt    Suppress echoing the prompt before generated response\n"
      "\n"
      "Sampling:\n"
      "  -n, --max-tokens <N>       Maximum number of new tokens to generate (default: 128)\n"
      "  -t, --temperature <T>      Randomness scale; 0 selects greedy (default: model/thinking preset)\n"
      "      --top-k <K>            Highest-logit token limit; 0 disables (default: model preset)\n"
      "      --top-p <P>            Cumulative probability cutoff (default: model/thinking preset)\n"
      "      --min-p <P>            Keep tokens with probability at least P times the best token (default: 0.0 = disabled)\n"
      "      --min-keep <N>         Minimum candidates retained by enabled sampling filters (default: 0)\n"
      "  -s, --seed <N>             RNG seed for reproducible generation (default: -1 = random)\n"
      "      --repeat-penalty <N>   Multiplicative penalty for recently used tokens (default: 1.0 = disabled)\n"
      "      --repeat-last-n <N>    Trailing token window used by repetition penalties (default: 64; 0 = disabled)\n"
      "      --frequency-penalty <N> Penalty multiplied by each token's generated occurrence count (default: 0.0 = disabled)\n"
      "      --presence-penalty <N> Generated-token presence penalty (default: model/thinking preset)\n"
      "\n"
      "Reasoning:\n"
      "      --think <MODE>         Reasoning mode: on, off, or auto (default: model)\n"
      "      --reasoning-effort <LEVEL> Effort: auto, minimal, low, medium, high, xhigh, or max\n"
      "      --preserve-thinking <MODE> Replay prior reasoning: on, off, or auto\n"
